<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Kenya - Pride of East Africa</title>
  <style>
    /* Reset and Base Styles */
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background-color: #090d0b;
      color: #f4f6f5;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    /* Main Profile Card */
    .card {
      background-color: #131a16;
      border: 1px solid #24332b;
      border-radius: 16px;
      max-width: 600px;
      width: 100%;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
    }

    /* Header Banner inspired by the Kenyan Flag */
    .banner {
      height: 120px;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #000000 0%, #990000 50%, #006600 100%);
    }

    /* Profile Content */
    .content {
      padding: 0 30px 30px;
      position: relative;
    }

    .avatar {
      width: 90px;
      height: 90px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background-color: #006600;
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 32px;
      font-weight: bold;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      border: 4px solid #ffffff;
      margin-top: -45px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 26px;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }

    .subtitle {
      color: #9ca3af;
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .bio {
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #d1d5db;
      font-size: 15px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    /* Highlights Grid */
    h2 {
      font-size: 15px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
      color: #9ca3af;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .highlights {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .highlight-item {
      background-color: #1a241e;
      padding: 12px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      border: 1px solid #24332b;
      transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .highlight-item:hover {
      border-color: #bb0000;
    }

    .highlight-item strong {
      display: block;
      color: #4ade80;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .highlight-item span {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #9ca3af;
    }

    /* National Motto Footer */
    blockquote {
      border-left: 3px solid #bb0000;
      padding-left: 14px;
      font-style: italic;
      color: #d1d5db;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="banner"></div>
    <div class="content">
      <div class="avatar">KE</div>
      <h1>REPUBLIC OF KENYA</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">East Africa &bull; Capital: Nairobi</p>
      
      <p class="bio">
        Located along the Indian Ocean in East Africa, Kenya is renowned for its dramatic landscapes, diverse wildlife reserves, rich cultural heritage, and fast-growing technology hub known as the "Silicon Savannah."
      </p>

      <h2>Key Highlights</h2>
      <div class="highlights">
        <div class="highlight-item">
          <strong>Maasai Mara</strong>
          <span>World-Famous Safari &amp; Great Migration</span>
        </div>
        <div class="highlight-item">
          <strong>Mount Kenya</strong>
          <span>Africa's Second-Highest Peak</span>
        </div>
        <div class="highlight-item">
          <strong>Nairobi</strong>
          <span>Regional Tech &amp; Financial Hub</span>
        </div>
        <div class="highlight-item">
          <strong>Diani &amp; Mombasa</strong>
          <span>White Sand Indian Ocean Coastline</span>
        </div>
        <div class="highlight-item">
          <strong>Lake Victoria</strong>
          <span>Freshwater Fishing &amp; Island Views</span>
        </div>
        <div class="highlight-item">
          <strong>Athletics</strong>
          <span>Global Champions in Distance Running</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <blockquote>
        "Harambee" — All pull together (National Motto)
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
